            <title><![CDATA[[webauthn-3] Web API: special note about algorithms EdDSA (-8) and ES256 (-7)]]></title>
            <link>https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46722</link>
            <guid>https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46722</guid>
            <pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:48:12 GMT</pubDate>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3 dir="auto">MDN URL</h3>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/PublicKeyCredentialCreationOptions" rel="nofollow">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/PublicKeyCredentialCreationOptions</a></p>
<h3 dir="auto">What specific section or headline is this issue about?</h3>
<p dir="auto">Instance properties</p>
<h3 dir="auto">What information was incorrect, unhelpful, or incomplete?</h3>
<p dir="auto">At the moment the documentation recommends the deprecated algorithms EdDSA (-8), and ES256 (-7):</p>
<blockquote>
<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6052909/720034220-f8fc6564-e5e1-4e36-815b-052511c3a127.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..cb6qjMMCwzP0PCRAa1efW_ePbMVcvDAB5KPDE9FXzSI"><img width="745" height="286" alt="image" src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6052909/720034220-f8fc6564-e5e1-4e36-815b-052511c3a127.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..cb6qjMMCwzP0PCRAa1efW_ePbMVcvDAB5KPDE9FXzSI" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 286px;; aspect-ratio: 745 / 286; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px" class="js-gh-image-fallback"></a>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/publickeycredentialcreationoptions/index.md">https://github.com/mdn/content/blob/main/files/en-us/web/api/publickeycredentialcreationoptions/index.md</a></p>
</blockquote>
<p dir="auto">A potential problem is that these algorithms EdDSA (-8), and ES256 (-7) are deprecated by the authority (COSE):</p>
<blockquote>
<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6052909/720034741-ad3050d7-6d1f-4559-9767-e113dbfdcec6.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..y7IkgnS9hTD1VohfyBAsBw9QxrdYo3R36sGhsOKDiCs"><img width="1426" height="43" alt="image" src="https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/6052909/720034741-ad3050d7-6d1f-4559-9767-e113dbfdcec6.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..y7IkgnS9hTD1VohfyBAsBw9QxrdYo3R36sGhsOKDiCs" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 43px;; aspect-ratio: 1426 / 43; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px" class="js-gh-image-fallback"></a>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://www.iana.org/assignments/cose#algorithms" rel="nofollow">https://www.iana.org/assignments/cose#algorithms</a></li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
<h3 dir="auto">What did you expect to see?</h3>
<p dir="auto">An extra note about the situation.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Do you have any supporting links, references, or citations?</h3>
<p dir="auto"><em>No response</em></p>
<h3 dir="auto">Do you have anything more you want to share?</h3>
<p dir="auto"><em>No response</em></p>
